              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku haahangwireho emyaka magana ana na makumi munaana Abaisraeli barugire Misri, Sulemaani yaatandika kwombeka enju ya MUKAMA, omu mwaka gwe gwa kana aherize kuza aha ngoma, omu kwezi kwa Ziivu, nikwo kwezi kwa kabiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
