            "sid": "1KI 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuryango ogw'ebishengye bya kaanyina-ibiri gukaba guri aha rubaju rwa buryo; bakaba batembera aha matembero agarikugyenda nigeezinga okuhika omu bishengye bya kaanyina-ibiri, n'okwogaho gakahika omuri kaanyina-isahtu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo nikwo yaayombekire egyo nju, akagiheza, akagishakaaza emiraba n'ambaaho eby'emyereezi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ebishengye by'ekyo kyombeko akabyombeka naabyegamiza hekalu, obwemi bwa buri kishengye bukaba buri mikono etaano, kandi ekyo kyombeko kikaba kiteerainwe n'enju ya hekalu n'emiraba y'emyereezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
