        },
        {
          "text": " Aha muheru gw'enju yaayombekaho ekisiika ky'embaaho z'emyereezi kya mikono makumi abiri okuruga ahansi okuhika aha miraba; ogwo mwanya gw'omwinziiro yaagugira omwanya ogurikwera ogw'omunda kuba Aharikwera munonga. ",
          "type": "text",
