          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ekishengye ky'omu maisho g'Omwanya ogurikwera ogw'omunda kikaba kiri mikono makumi ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebisiika by'ekyo kishengye bikaba bishwekirwe embaaho z'emyereezi omunda, ezisharwirweho ebishushani by'ebisisi, n'eby'ebirabyo ebijanjamwire. Kyona kikaba kishwekirwe embaaho z'emyereezi, hataine ibaare ririkureebwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogwo Mwanya gurikwera ogw'omunda, ogwabaire guri aha muheru gw'egyo nju yaagushemeza kutamu eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ogwo mwanya gukaba guri mikono makumi abiri oburaingwa, makumi abiri obukiika, kandi makumi abiri obwemi; bwanyima yaagushweka ezaabu eshemeziibwe; kandi egyo zaabu yaagishweka n'eitambiro eryabaire rishwekirwe embaaho z'emyereezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Sulemaani yaashweka enju yoona omunda ezaabu; omu maisho g'Omwanya ogurikwera ogw'omunda yaacwekanisaho enjegyere z'ezaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
