          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi aha bisiika by'Omwanya ogurikwera ogw'omunda n'ogw'omumaisho yaasharuraho ebishushani bya baakerubi, n'eby'emikindo n'eby'ebirabyo bijanjamwire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahansi omu myanya egyo yombi yaahashweka ezaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aharikutaaha omu Mwanya ogurikwera ogw'omunda yaataho enyigi z'embaaho z'emizeituuni; ekisasi n'ebiti by'ogwo muryango byaba kimwe kya kataano ky'ekyo kisiika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezo nyigi zombi ez'emizeituuni yaazisharuraho ebishushani bya baakerubi, n'eby'emikindo, n'eby'ebirabyo bijanjamwire, yaazishweka ezaabu, kandi ebyo bishushani bya baakerubi n'eby'emikindo yaabisiiga ezaabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
