          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kwezi kwa Buula nikwo kwezi kwa munaana okw'omwaka gwa ikumi na gumwe baagiheza n'emyanya yaayo yoona, nk'oku yaabaire eteekateekirwe kwombekwa. Yaamara emyaka mushanju naagyombeka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
